 <----------------------------------> API Integration <---------------------------------------------->
 // what is API:
 An API (Application Programming Interface) is a software intermediary that allows two different
  applications to communicate and share data or functionality with each other.

  fetch k sat response ko json my convert krna pary ga

  useEffect my hum api lany k liye fetch use krty hain 
  magr is k elwah hum Axios ka bi use kr skty hain

  for install : npm install axios (ye bi api fetch k liye use hota hain)
  axios by default json return krta hain

  <---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------->
  <---------------------------> React-Router-Dom <------------------------------------------------>
  // React- Router_ dom:
  React Router DOM ek JavaScript library hai jo web applications me browser
   URL ke mutabiq alag-alag pages
   (components) ko bina page reload kiye dikhane (routing ke liye) use hoti hai

   //  For install :
   npm website search ( instal react router dom):
   write in vs terminal:
   npm i react-router-dom


   // update main.jsx file:

  import { StrictMode } from 'react'
import { createRoot } from 'react-dom/client'
import './index.css'
import App from './App.jsx'
import { BrowserRouter } from 'react-router-dom' // ye import krna hain

createRoot(document.getElementById('root')).render(
  <StrictMode>
    <BrowserRouter>  // app ko browser my wrap krna hain
    <App />
    </BrowserRouter>
  </StrictMode>,
)



/// navlink:
Link simple navigation ke liye use hota hai, jabki NavLink uski 
ka advanced version hai jo active page ke link ko
 automatically highlight (style ya class add) karne ke liye use hota hai.


 // useNavigate:
 useNavigate ek hook hai jo aapko code (jaise button click ya form submit) ke zariye
  zabardasti user ko dusre page par bhejne (programmatic navigation) ke liye use hota hai.


  <-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------->

  <-----------------------------> Context api <--------------------------------------------->

  //Context api:
  Context API React ka aik built-in feature hai jo aap ko poori
   application mein data (state) ko asaani se share karne
   ki ijazat deta hai, baghair har level par props pass kiye (jise "prop drilling" kaha jata hai).


   <--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------->
   <-----------------------> Reusable code <------------------------------------------------->

   // Reusable code :
   React Reusable Component aik aisa isolated code block 
   (button, card, ya input field) hota hai jise aik baar bana kar poori application mein alag-alag
    jagah alag data ke sath bar bar istemal (reuse) kiya jata hai taake code duplicate na ho.

    /// React composition:
    React Composition aik aisi technique hai jahan chote aur
     alag-alag components ko aapas mein jor kar (combine kar ke) 
    aik naya aur bara component banaya jata hai, taake code flexible aur reusable rahe.